TITLE Conductance question
SOLUTION 1
    temp 150
    pH 7 charge
    pe 4
    units mol/kgw
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 1
    -temperature 150
    -volume 1
    CH4(g) 10
    CO2(g) 10
    NH3(g) 5
PRINT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel.out
    -reset false
    -solution 1
    -ionic_strength true
    -equilibrium_phases true
USER_PUNCH
    -headings sc
    10 PUNCH SC
END